  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Category:</strong> Luxury</p>\n<p><strong>Fabrication:</strong> DV29 - 5,000eb - 1 Month</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible:</strong> All Non-Explosive Power Weapons</p>\n<p><em>This experimental Militech device uses nanobots to turn any munitions into bunker busters by adding miniature exothermic warheads.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Iconic Weapon Mod.</strong> All ammunition fired from the weapon now functions like an Explosive for the purposes of carrying damage to targets behind destroyed Cover, and whenever it would ablate armor, it ablates 1 additional SP. If the weapon already has its fired ammunition functioning like an Explosive when interacting with Cover, all damage it deals to Cover (and only Cover) is now doubled.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Iconic: it can't be bought or sourced on the street, can't be fabricated without its Blueprint, can't be taken during Character Generation, and once acquired can't be destroyed unless the player agrees to it beforehand.</li>\n<li>The price is the Luxury benchmark, for working out repairs and Tech Upgrades. Iconics can't be bought.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Becoming Iconic &gt; Iconic Weapons).</em></p>"
